27508      ods graphics on;
27509      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
27510      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
27511      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27512      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE TRANSREG printed page 1689.

27513      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
27514      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
27515      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
27516      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
27517      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
NOTE: All statistics are mean corrected.
NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
