27518      * Separate Intercepts;
27519      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive;
27520      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none)
27521      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
27522      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
